; board-del.sabra — the canonical board delete (board.borg L5).
;
; The prim's op kind is the canonical "delete", retiring the host
; page's nonstandard "del" op kind with the swap.  Deleted items are
; interesting to rewind-as-fold: the op chain records the version so
; the fold replays the tombstone.

(lambda (path)
  (prim "tree/del" path))
